; Mini-FAT Z80 sources. The object directory is ${TYPE}.
; TYPE=z80, TYPE=z180, and TYPE=z80n each have those sources assembled for that CPU.
; fat_sync stays in fatfs.
; The other C calls, and each f_* object, are linked only when called.
; 8085 lists the same calls in minifat_8085.lst.
; 8080 lists the same calls in minifat_8080.lst.
; ixiy lists the same calls in minifat_ixiy.lst.
; gbz80 lists the same calls in minifat_gbz80.lst.
; vm1 lists the same calls in minifat_vm1.lst.
